few rounds, a miniboss round will come. After two miniboss rounds, one out of four bosses will appear.\n#YELLOW#Kill enemies before the gates close #LAST#to raise your score multiplier!.\n#YELLOW#Kill several enemies at once or very strong enemies #LAST#to please the audience and increase your rank!.\n#YELLOW#Collect gold #LAST#to increase your score and resources at the end of each round.\n#YELLOW#Kill enemies fast to get better scores!\n#YELLOW#Take advantage of the trap at the center of the arena!\nGood luck!\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#你发现了一张标出了若干重点词语的便条……\n#{bold}#竞技场规则\n\n#{normal}#竞技场的规则很简单。\n在每一波里，大门将打开，并放出一些敌人。当大门关上时，你将得到一些奖励分。\n奖励分将会#YELLOW#每回合减少 #LAST#，但#YELLOW#此时被你杀死的敌人#LAST#会提高奖励分。\n当你击败所有敌人时，你将获得奖励分乘以奖励倍率所得的分数。\n\n每隔几轮就会有一轮小头目战。经过两轮小头目战后，四名头目之一将会出现。\n#YELLOW#在大门关上前击杀敌人#LAST#以提高分数倍率！\n#YELLOW#一次击杀多个敌人或非常强大的敌人#LAST#以取悦观众并提高你的等级！\n#YELLOW#收集金币#LAST#以在每轮结束时提高分数并获得更多资源。\n#YELLOW#迅速击杀敌人以获得更高分数！\n#YELLOW#好好利用场地中心的陷阱！\n祝君好运！\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"5b9508dc515305ef83ea5a7d4280c882852299b8e00db44b9db6416591b26eec","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9763579ae64b360257b2114ad8e0935dcad15756ac38022c61f1ccd8655ad434","logical_entry_identity":"73490554fb9a40e91200d1988a6c7591dc2714f9c9cfc76ffaea11f94b9d02ef","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You already fully know this talent!","source_tag":"_t","target":"你已完全掌握此技能！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"bf8cd776c54daa921506351419430e6ca2fecd3c36f3d64885a949437130e4e6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"9763d0cce5f0a1d41ac53e11962db97a8051b698099a94288d8fc52fb425b14d","logical_entry_identity":"45a5efe8a7725eba8f2d2c079c18ac1396d0c1770cb9a9be3e49d8ef91897d79","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD#Damage affinity: all#LAST#\nAll damage you receive, through any means, also heals you for this percentage of the damage.\nThis stacks with individual damage type affinities.\nImportant: Affinity healing happens after damage has been taken, it can not prevent death.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD#伤害亲和：全体#LAST#\n任何方式对你造成的所有类型伤害，都会按此比例治疗你。\n可以与独立类型的伤害亲和效果叠加。\n注意：伤害亲和的治疗在伤害结算之后才生效，不能防止死亡。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"096385aae1bcbce8ea277e079876b978aafd263395bef69674e9efc794d8a55e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"976464c0af1edae5fe4aa7fbd7f06522b297917c6ca79eabc1d956effaa33c72","logical_entry_identity":"eb74af24fe365839c9c4d70bdfd83ecf5c8af2caf92b633e064a2de6f726dc36","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Alchemical control over stone and gems.","source_tag":"_t","target":"岩石和宝石炼金术。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c3fd4fca7220e9d2dc55c08ed99cc8b7fa531a31f0f979865b62b1dcc676e847","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"976c5a3c63a709af3ecf8832068a5c76a64f6d302299e02743a7ab5e822a1623","logical_entry_identity":"5aca389c93b9908fb43e2e39fd4f087ddf5dc8937e3df3adacdd79c21fe9a2a2","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Right click to inspect.","source_tag":"_t","target":"右击检查。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"be56e8cf6f437ccf8040771bad7b00ca37cf5ed8d8ccc2f7e0307f2d9518e8e6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"976d8de85c54bf188127cdecd5c688bd0797fef028306ba70b67e88e8b372ce6","logical_entry_identity":"3cd3d19482c46a1014d62d4b3308a837dbe25cc101fd591f27b9128cabea5dbf","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"This wild infusion has evolved.","source_tag":"_t","target":"这个野性纹身已经进化了。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"706affdd4d565fab14ec5722f0ddf5ddfa9df8070a14b4cbb871cf787df8b4aa","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"976fba9a45d7461d55e6518ac039cf611d024208a18d6a80ac2cc23a1e352bdd","logical_entry_identity":"a0d19389d5c4d4a0da9c9866d45b1775e5744d8fbc90d3c5fbc9ea9c4f141aec","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Mindworm","source_tag":"entity name","target":"心灵蠕虫"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"1d3ae5d3add1c3193b7bf8516a28767ff306fda6b01c917ea88799e7edcc147f","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"977589e218042838f29727ec35cb26ce5feb7ebcda2620d7c